WEBVTT

00:00.630 --> 00:04.900
The fireworks are going to set the mood 
for you to get closer to Mukai-kun

00:05.200 --> 00:07.440
and get ahead of Minase-san.

00:09.440 --> 00:11.740
Look at all those stalls!

00:11.740 --> 00:15.120
The fireworks festival here 
is famous for being pretty.

00:15.120 --> 00:16.950
I can't wait.

00:18.130 --> 00:19.000
Huh?

00:19.850 --> 00:22.540
Where is Naoya?

00:22.540 --> 00:23.770
Let's split up and find him.

00:23.770 --> 00:25.040
We can still make it.

00:25.320 --> 00:26.080
Okay.

00:26.080 --> 00:26.750
Hey!

00:32.150 --> 00:34.860
I have an idea.

00:42.480 --> 00:44.750
Saki-chan!

00:44.750 --> 00:46.860
Minase-san!

00:48.810 --> 00:51.190
I have to find them quick!

00:51.190 --> 00:53.150
We promised to watch the fireworks together!

00:55.510 --> 00:57.680
We're going to make memories together!

01:04.830 --> 01:06.040
Minase-san!

01:07.380 --> 01:09.250
Naoya-kun!

01:09.970 --> 01:13.210
Naoya-kun!

01:13.210 --> 01:16.180
Minase-san!

01:18.070 --> 01:19.040
Huh?

01:19.040 --> 01:21.850
Mukai-kun... and Minase-san?

01:29.080 --> 01:33.610
<i>Sh-She's Saki-chan's friend!</i>

01:33.610 --> 01:38.990
<i>We can't let people from class know 
about my relationship with Naoya-kun!</i>

01:48.000 --> 01:59.970
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

03:13.230 --> 03:16.600
Mukai-kun and... Minase-san, right?

03:18.120 --> 03:20.010
Y-Yay!

03:20.010 --> 03:21.880
They have cotton candy!

03:21.880 --> 03:23.830
I'd like some, please!

03:25.260 --> 03:26.720
<i>So cute!</i>

03:26.720 --> 03:28.620
<i>This is so embarrassing!</i>

03:29.560 --> 03:33.030
I-I'm gonna go eat in the park over there.

03:34.050 --> 03:37.320
Oh, shoot! I have somewhere to be, too.

03:45.220 --> 03:49.520
Come to think of it, of course there are 
going to be people from class at the festival.

03:49.520 --> 03:52.160
Y-Yeah...

03:58.090 --> 04:01.600
Wait, we gotta hurry, 
or the fireworks are going to end!

04:01.600 --> 04:03.050
We have to find Saki-chan!

04:03.050 --> 04:05.770
I'll be waiting for Saki-san here.

04:05.770 --> 04:07.140
It'll be all right.

04:07.140 --> 04:09.350
Oh, really?

04:09.350 --> 04:14.440
S-So... Saki-san and I promised...

04:16.900 --> 04:23.260
If I met you first, 
I'd get to spend time with you.

04:26.160 --> 04:29.800
I want to watch the fireworks together

04:30.500 --> 04:37.240
and make summer memories with you.

04:44.930 --> 04:47.760
It's dark here.

04:48.200 --> 04:51.020
We don't have to worry about being caught.

04:51.560 --> 04:53.000
Minase-san...

04:54.980 --> 04:56.060
All right!

04:56.060 --> 04:57.690
Let's focus on the fireworks!

04:58.470 --> 05:00.060
Thank you!

05:00.400 --> 05:01.930
Yum!

05:00.400 --> 05:05.360
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

05:00.400 --> 05:05.360
<b>Yum...!</b>

05:01.400 --> 05:05.360
<b>Has totally forgotten about looking for Naoya</b>

05:09.640 --> 05:11.770
W-Well...

05:12.290 --> 05:13.750
Pardon me!

05:21.970 --> 05:24.410
<i>Minase-san's being so assertive!</i>

05:28.740 --> 05:31.760
Th-The fireworks are pretty, aren't they?

05:29.050 --> 05:31.760
<b>Thump</b>

05:29.050 --> 05:31.760
<b>Thump</b>

05:32.370 --> 05:34.500
<i>She's really trying.</i>

05:34.980 --> 05:37.690
<i>I want to answer her wishes!</i>

05:39.020 --> 05:42.480
<i>N-N-N-Naoya-kun?!</i>

05:47.450 --> 05:51.080
I-If that's where you're going with this...

05:53.040 --> 05:55.250
I-In that case...

05:55.540 --> 05:56.380
Here!

06:06.470 --> 06:08.460
W-We aren't watching the fireworks!

06:08.460 --> 06:09.770
You're right!

06:21.410 --> 06:26.280
Still, I get to be together with you.

06:27.940 --> 06:29.580
I'm really happy.

06:32.390 --> 06:33.830
Minase-san...

06:41.970 --> 06:43.590
About what happened...

06:44.480 --> 06:49.180
How we still have to hide our 
relationship from people...

06:49.840 --> 06:50.730
Sorry!

06:51.660 --> 06:54.120
N-No, it's fine.

06:54.640 --> 06:58.400
I'm more happy that I'm going out with you

06:58.400 --> 07:02.230
than I am sad that I have to keep it a secret.

07:02.620 --> 07:08.190
Still, though, I really am 
putting a heavy burden on you.

07:13.570 --> 07:16.590
You're right that it's 
a difficult relationship,

07:16.590 --> 07:20.380
and we'll probably face all sorts 
of problems going forward.

07:32.300 --> 07:33.620
But still,

07:34.670 --> 07:40.410
if I get to be with you next year 
and the year after that...

07:41.520 --> 07:48.820
If you're still going to look at me, 
I think it'll have been worth it.

07:54.840 --> 08:00.920
Of course, part of me does want you for myself.

08:07.090 --> 08:12.550
But the Naoya-kun I fell in love with was 
the Naoya-kun who's in love with Saki-san.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.940
Minase-san...

08:24.740 --> 08:26.230
Naoya!

08:26.230 --> 08:28.190
Nagisa-chan!

08:28.190 --> 08:29.530
Saki-chan.

08:29.840 --> 08:31.600
Well, I'll be going.

08:31.600 --> 08:33.360
I promised to switch places here.

08:35.480 --> 08:41.410
Don't tell her about what we did 
when we were alone. It's embarrassing.

08:42.620 --> 08:44.340
B-Bye.

08:47.200 --> 08:48.250
Naoya.

08:48.850 --> 08:51.300
What were you and Nagisa-chan doing together?

08:51.300 --> 08:54.010
W-Well...

08:54.550 --> 08:55.590
I can't tell you!

08:55.590 --> 08:57.070
Hella suspicious!

08:57.430 --> 09:03.390
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

08:57.430 --> 09:03.390
<b>I got really far with 
Naoya-kun really quickly...</b>

08:57.940 --> 09:02.310
I got really far with 
Naoya-kun really quickly...

09:07.320 --> 09:11.360
Are you really not going to tell me 
what you were doing with Nagisa-chan?

09:11.710 --> 09:13.570
She said she'd be embarrassed.

09:13.570 --> 09:15.820
You did something to be embarrassed about?!

09:16.120 --> 09:17.160
Can't tell you.

09:20.230 --> 09:21.820
Anyway, Saki-chan...

09:22.540 --> 09:26.490
let's switch gears, 
watch the fireworks, set the mood,

09:26.490 --> 09:28.710
and kiss to remember this beautiful day!

09:28.710 --> 09:31.170
I'm in no mood!

09:32.050 --> 09:34.130
I feel like shit!

09:37.860 --> 09:41.350
But the fireworks are almost over.

09:43.120 --> 09:45.040
I couldn't get the mood 
right last time, either!

09:45.040 --> 09:46.650
And I failed to kiss you!

09:47.550 --> 09:51.000
I have a feeling I'll miss the next chance 
if I miss my chance today!

09:53.480 --> 09:56.780
I don't want this to go on forever

09:57.210 --> 10:00.040
and keep making you wait!

10:03.480 --> 10:05.950
Or do you not want to kiss me anymore?

10:05.950 --> 10:07.160
I do!

10:07.160 --> 10:08.870
Why would you make me say it?!

10:14.480 --> 10:15.460
Saki-chan?

10:15.940 --> 10:17.310
Sure.

10:17.310 --> 10:19.960
It doesn't matter what you're 
doing with Nagisa-chan.

10:19.960 --> 10:22.890
I'm just going to do what I need to do.

10:25.160 --> 10:28.440
Let's watch the fireworks and set the mood!

10:28.440 --> 10:30.390
Yeah! Let's do it!

10:39.610 --> 10:41.830
<i>Calm your mind.</i>

10:48.800 --> 10:51.800
I just got a hell of a whiff of 
Nagisa-chan's scent from you!

10:52.290 --> 10:54.580
No, wait... Is this...

10:55.170 --> 11:00.680
It's Shino's and Mirika's scents! 
And some other woman's I don't know!

11:00.680 --> 11:02.260
How can you even tell?

11:02.260 --> 11:03.070
Huh?

11:03.070 --> 11:05.560
They're cute girls. 
Who wouldn't remember their scents?

11:05.560 --> 11:06.720
Is that a thing?

11:07.750 --> 11:08.510
So...

11:09.400 --> 11:17.900
Wh-What were you doing with all 
those women while I-I w-was gone?

11:18.680 --> 11:20.610
Nothing to be ashamed of.

11:24.680 --> 11:27.070
We just made contact because reasons!

11:27.070 --> 11:28.580
That sounds hella shameful!

11:28.980 --> 11:31.780
I swear, it was nothing! 
Let's watch the fireworks!

11:35.490 --> 11:37.320
W-Well...

11:37.320 --> 11:39.590
I guess you wouldn't lie.

11:41.680 --> 11:43.010
Yeah.

11:46.640 --> 11:51.530
This is the first summer fireworks festival 
since we started going out.

11:51.530 --> 11:53.850
I'd regret not enjoying it.

11:57.840 --> 12:03.130
We've spent a lot of summers 
together since we were kids.

12:04.880 --> 12:10.710
But unlike then, we're in a relationship now.

12:14.680 --> 12:16.250
And...

12:20.210 --> 12:22.360
We're grown up.

12:25.180 --> 12:26.920
And...

12:32.140 --> 12:33.390
<b>Nagisa's scent</b>

12:33.840 --> 12:36.100
I'm being two-timed.

12:36.730 --> 12:39.440
Isn't this pretty sad for me?!

12:40.320 --> 12:42.970
I can't focus at all!

12:42.970 --> 12:45.600
This is why I hate two-timing!

12:45.600 --> 12:47.050
Calm down! Please!

12:47.050 --> 12:48.410
Let's watch the fireworks!

12:48.720 --> 12:50.880
Please stop shouting!

12:49.240 --> 12:54.820
<i>The fireworks festival is now over.</i>

13:00.960 --> 13:05.970
<b>Emergency repairs complete...</b>

13:00.960 --> 13:05.970
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

13:01.770 --> 13:03.450
Emergency repairs complete.

13:12.770 --> 13:16.980
My fireworks festival with Naoya...

13:18.680 --> 13:19.820
is over?

13:20.400 --> 13:21.860
Just a second!

13:22.610 --> 13:23.690
<b>Dash</b>

13:23.400 --> 13:24.530
<b>Dash</b>

13:25.570 --> 13:26.610
<b>Dash</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:27.410
<b>Dash</b>

13:30.710 --> 13:33.340
I bought fireworks!

13:35.250 --> 13:38.250
<b>Stare...</b>

13:38.640 --> 13:42.210
N-No?

13:43.570 --> 13:49.060
We missed the fireworks festival, 
so you bought us sparklers instead?

13:49.840 --> 13:51.700
How cliché could this get?

13:52.280 --> 13:54.000
Well...

13:54.000 --> 13:55.430
Yes.

13:58.650 --> 14:00.170
But still...

14:00.940 --> 14:03.370
Not a bad idea. Let's do it!

14:04.820 --> 14:06.100
Saki-chan...

14:07.560 --> 14:10.160
Which one should I pick?

14:13.620 --> 14:17.580
I keep causing you trouble 
because of my two-timing,

14:17.580 --> 14:19.640
yet you keep accepting me.

14:19.640 --> 14:20.760
Thanks.

14:20.760 --> 14:22.540
Wh-Where did that come from?

14:23.000 --> 14:25.800
If it wasn't you that I was going out with,

14:26.520 --> 14:29.540
I don't think it would have gotten anywhere.

14:32.360 --> 14:33.770
Naoya...

14:34.680 --> 14:37.310
But that's why...

14:37.890 --> 14:42.060
She started going out with you, 
and another girl came along.

14:42.850 --> 14:46.410
And that girl even kissed you first.

14:47.380 --> 14:50.580
There's no way she's okay with that.

14:51.510 --> 14:56.120
I want to know how you feel in this moment.

14:59.590 --> 15:02.500
How I feel?

15:03.270 --> 15:06.310
Since the three of us started living together,

15:06.710 --> 15:08.880
and with all that happened with Mirika-san,

15:08.880 --> 15:10.930
and with Shino-san having caught us...

15:10.930 --> 15:13.740
We're dealing with way more 
problems than in the beginning.

15:14.970 --> 15:16.540
Are you...

15:18.890 --> 15:20.770
happy that I've started two-timing you?

15:20.770 --> 15:22.860
How could I be?!

15:23.480 --> 15:25.580
Are you mental?!

15:26.040 --> 15:28.690
Y-You're right.

15:29.130 --> 15:34.160
B-But all the more, I want to hear the truth.

15:35.620 --> 15:40.910
What do you think about 
our relationship right now?

15:40.910 --> 15:43.330
Are you hiding any pain?

15:47.220 --> 15:50.250
To be honest, I'm scared,

15:51.330 --> 15:54.280
but I want to learn about you.

15:55.730 --> 15:57.740
I think I need to learn about you.

15:58.980 --> 16:00.570
Naoya...

16:07.480 --> 16:13.440
If I said it really hurts and 
I can't take it anymore...

16:13.440 --> 16:14.990
What would you do?

16:14.990 --> 16:16.490
I'd figure it out!

16:16.490 --> 16:17.950
That's it?!

16:19.780 --> 16:21.750
Jeez, Naoya...

16:22.360 --> 16:24.670
W-Well?

16:31.290 --> 16:33.130
Why don't we go ahead with the fireworks?

16:34.020 --> 16:35.600
You bought them, after all.

16:36.230 --> 16:37.870
Y-Yeah.

16:44.550 --> 16:46.860
It's been ages since I played with fireworks.

16:49.280 --> 16:51.790
I bet Shino gave you an earful, didn't she?

16:51.790 --> 16:54.030
W-Well...

16:54.030 --> 16:56.610
Yeah, she did.

17:00.360 --> 17:03.980
Sure, I get lonely.

17:06.130 --> 17:10.000
You used to look only at me.

17:10.000 --> 17:12.090
And then you met Nagisa-chan.

17:13.400 --> 17:19.130
I realized I can't have your heart to myself.

17:21.410 --> 17:24.260
Even if I made a fuss 
and forced you to break up,

17:24.710 --> 17:28.440
Nagisa-chan would still be on your mind.

17:29.960 --> 17:33.530
That does kinda sting.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.260
But...

17:37.350 --> 17:40.660
I still like you, Naoya.

17:42.960 --> 17:44.860
You're ridiculously honest,

17:44.860 --> 17:46.730
you're earnest,

17:46.730 --> 17:48.550
and you don't know when to give up.

17:48.980 --> 17:50.380
And I love you.

17:51.090 --> 17:53.720
Sure, I wanted to beat the 
shit out of you when you

17:53.720 --> 17:55.800
started saying you wanted to two-time me.

17:58.080 --> 18:00.720
But there was a part of me that was amused

18:00.720 --> 18:03.930
that you couldn't lie to me, 
even in that situation.

18:04.690 --> 18:08.140
I mean, sure, I didn't know 
what to do in the beginning.

18:11.920 --> 18:17.930
I don't know how our relationship, 
including Nagisa-chan, is going to go.

18:20.570 --> 18:25.540
But I'm not particularly worried 
about my relationship with you.

18:27.340 --> 18:31.960
You've always said you loved me.

18:31.960 --> 18:33.880
Saki-chan! I love you!

18:33.880 --> 18:36.670
Over and over, from way back.

18:35.300 --> 18:36.670
I love you!

18:36.670 --> 18:38.260
I love you, Saki-chan!

18:38.260 --> 18:39.630
Like an idiot.

18:39.630 --> 18:41.320
I love you, Saki-chan!

18:41.720 --> 18:43.490
I love you!

18:43.490 --> 18:44.650
For years...

18:45.100 --> 18:46.700
I love you!

18:46.700 --> 18:48.100
...and years.

18:55.800 --> 18:56.870
Which is why

18:57.880 --> 19:04.700
I totally believe you're going 
to continue loving me.

19:05.560 --> 19:08.220
Saki-chan...

19:08.940 --> 19:11.880
Maybe I'm just the idiot here.

19:13.780 --> 19:17.090
So you don't have to worry about me.

19:17.540 --> 19:22.050
I love you, and you love me.

19:22.630 --> 19:25.660
And we get to do fireworks together like this.

19:25.660 --> 19:27.980
And every day ends up being fun.

19:29.040 --> 19:31.980
I'm pretty happy for the time being.

19:40.400 --> 19:42.190
All I can say about the two-timing is that

19:42.190 --> 19:44.910
you're gonna have to do 
your best to convince me.

19:45.990 --> 19:48.060
And if you do have any kind of 
sexy times with Nagisa-chan

19:48.060 --> 19:49.750
before you convince me, I'll kill you.

19:51.020 --> 19:52.040
Naoya?

19:52.840 --> 19:54.820
I'm so glad it was you.

19:57.420 --> 20:02.880
I'm so glad you're the one I fell in love with.

20:02.880 --> 20:05.180
Come on, Naoya!

20:07.650 --> 20:09.350
Oh, jeez.

20:14.790 --> 20:20.300
I really want to make you happy.

20:24.740 --> 20:26.070
Do your best.

20:29.560 --> 20:33.550
Hey, since we have all these fireworks, 
why don't we call the others?

20:33.550 --> 20:36.460
I have signal again, since the festival ended.

20:44.290 --> 20:45.460
Check this out.

20:47.360 --> 20:48.890
Wow!

20:49.440 --> 20:52.580
Man, we've made some good memories.

20:53.920 --> 20:55.940
Hey, Sakisaki...

21:01.740 --> 21:03.380
Did you two kiss?

21:07.030 --> 21:10.990
<b>Thump</b>

21:07.030 --> 21:10.990
<b>Thump</b>

21:07.460 --> 21:08.840
Kiss?

21:12.450 --> 21:14.830
Wait... What?

21:14.830 --> 21:16.090
You forgot?!

21:16.090 --> 21:18.860
Well, actually... stuff happened...

21:18.860 --> 21:20.800
What could happen that would make you forget?!

21:20.800 --> 21:23.560
L-Let's not worry about that!

21:23.560 --> 21:25.770
C-Come on, let's do fireworks!

21:25.770 --> 21:28.010
Wait... Sakisaki?!

21:42.200 --> 21:45.610
How could nothing have happened again?

21:47.060 --> 21:52.920
Is Sakisaki really serious about Mukai-kun?

21:55.680 --> 21:58.350
Onee-chan, how was the festival?

21:58.350 --> 21:59.960
Risa!

21:59.960 --> 22:02.800
I got more out of it than I expected!

22:02.800 --> 22:04.670
Huh. Good job.

22:07.320 --> 22:12.040
I can't let myself fall in love with you.

22:12.890 --> 22:15.060
So... I'm sorry.

22:18.310 --> 22:22.470
Does that mean Naoya notices me?

22:23.880 --> 22:26.100
I can't miss this opportunity.

22:26.950 --> 22:29.360
July 31st.

22:29.360 --> 22:31.030
I'm abducting Naoya!

22:32.490 --> 22:37.000
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

22:32.780 --> 22:33.870
Next episode...

22:33.870 --> 22:36.310
My sister's becoming a criminal?!

22:37.000 --> 22:42.000
<b>Fireworks with the Girlfriends</b>

24:12.680 --> 24:15.050
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

24:15.050 --> 24:17.140
Saki-chan and crew are 
going camping in episode 5!

24:17.140 --> 24:20.040
I should get this out of the way: I'm sorry.

24:20.040 --> 24:22.400
Wait, Risa-pon, are you apologizing because...

24:22.400 --> 24:23.120
Well...

24:23.120 --> 24:25.360
You're in love with Naoya, too?!

24:25.360 --> 24:26.700
No, that's not happening.
